### The App Idea: **VaultFlow** — Recurring Cashflow & Subscription Radar
Everyone quietly bleeds money through forgotten SaaS tools, streaming plans, domains, cloud bills, and mistimed recurring payments—and most users hate handing their bank passwords to third-party finance apps.

**VaultFlow** is a **privacy-first, offline-first subscription & recurring burn-rate radar** with a killer interactive feature: **"What-If" Simulation Mode**. Users can drag around a glowing radial burn dial with haptic detents, swipe bills to simulate pausing them, and watch their annual cashflow savings recalculate in real time.

